16,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I agree. Knowing the total cost upfront prevents surprises. I’ll stick with my choices.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Midori,,I agree. Understanding how we spent time together last year will help us choose a setting that feels right for all of us.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
