35,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"- **Sakura**: I found the island house is about 5,400 yen a head a night, but food is extra.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"The all-in rate charges the light eater the same as the biggest appetite, while separate meals settle at what each person actually orders.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Midori,,"Last year we barely saw each other between meals, and the shared house left no room for quiet time.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Midori"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Midori: Last year we barely saw each other between meals, and the shared house left no room for quiet time.""}]}"
38,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"The city trains run every few minutes, so nobody has to plan ahead to move.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Dinner is at six, breakfast at half seven, and we share one room on futons.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Sakura,,- **Sakura**: That’s a lot of extra money for food. I need to know the city bed prices too.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"- **Victoria**: And separately booked rooms varied by nearly eight thousand yen last time, whereas a whole house is one even bill.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Midori,,That explains the loneliness. I need to know if a town with streets and a public bath would fix that.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Midori"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Midori: That explains the loneliness. I need to know if a town with streets and a public bath would fix that.""}]}"
43,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"- **Toshio**: The spa valley bus stops before seven, which limits evening movement.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"- **Daisuke**: One bathroom for the whole building, and the water runs cold. That sounds difficult for me.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Sakura,,"- **Sakura**: The valley inn is about 17,000 yen with meals included. That’s much higher than the island house base rate.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"Midori, a town with streets might give us that balance. I’m still weighing the cost certainty against the shared house’s even bill.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Midori,,I think a town with streets and a public bath would give us that balance.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Midori"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Midori: I think a town with streets and a public bath would give us that balance.""}]}"
48,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"The ninety-minute train is manageable, but the ferry takes two days. I prefer the train option.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Toshio"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Toshio: The ninety-minute train is manageable, but the ferry takes two days. I prefer the train option.""}]}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,The fixed mealtimes and shared room are worrying. I need to know if there’s a private space to sit.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Daisuke"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Daisuke: The fixed mealtimes and shared room are worrying. I need to know if there’s a private space to sit.""}]}"
50,2,4,talk,Sakura,,"- **Sakura**: The city bed is 12,000 to 20,000 yen, plus meals. The island house is cheaper upfront, but food adds up.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Victoria,,"The city bed range is wide, but the island’s single bill divides evenly. I’d rather know the total before we commit.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Victoria"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Victoria: The city bed range is wide, but the island’s single bill divides evenly. I’d rather know the total before we commit.""}]}"
52,2,4,talk,Midori,,"I agree. The shared house felt too crowded, but last year’s separation felt too empty. I need a middle ground.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Midori"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Midori: I agree. The shared house felt too crowded, but last year’s separation felt too empty. I need a middle ground.""}]}"
53,2,4,talk,Toshio,,"The ninety-minute train is manageable, but the ferry takes two days. I prefer the train option.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,I’m worried about the cold water and fixed times. I need a place where I can wash and sit comfortably.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Daisuke"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Daisuke: I’m worried about the cold water and fixed times. I need a place where I can wash and sit comfortably.""}]}"
