60,3,1,talk,Sakura,,"- **Sakura**: Okay, we have the options now. Which one are you leaning toward?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Victoria,,"I’m leaning toward the island. One bill, divided evenly, means I know the total cost before we commit.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Midori,,I’m leaning toward the hot spring town. The streets and public bath might give us the balance we’re missing.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Toshio,,I’m leaning toward the hot spring town. The ninety-minute train is far better than losing two days to the ferry.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,I’m leaning toward the city. A private room with a door means I can wash and sit without a fixed timetable.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Sakura,,"- **Sakura**: The island’s single bill is nice, but the city’s separate rooms mean we each pay exactly what we use.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Victoria,,I object. The city’s separate rooms caused nearly eight thousand yen in differences last time. I need the certainty of one shared bill.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Midori,,"I understand the cost certainty, Victoria, but the island’s single bathroom and cold water worry me. The town offers a middle ground.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Midori"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Midori: I understand the cost certainty, Victoria, but the island’s single bathroom and cold water worry me. The town offers a middle ground.""}]}"
68,3,2,talk,Toshio,,I agree with Midori. The island’s cold water and the city’s lack of structure both feel wrong. The town’s train access is the only one that respects my time.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I’m sorry, but the fixed mealtimes and shared room at the inn still feel too restrictive. I need my own space to breathe.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Sakura,,"- **Sakura**: But if we split the city costs evenly, nobody ends up out of pocket. That solves the money worry.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Victoria,,"I disagree. Splitting evenly ignores that we actually spent different amounts. I need the bill to reflect reality, not an arbitrary average.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Midori,,"I hear you, Victoria. But the town’s all-in rate covers meals, so the bill is fixed and fair for everyone, without the cold water.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Midori"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Midori: I hear you, Victoria. But the town’s all-in rate covers meals, so the bill is fixed and fair for everyone, without the cold water.""}]}"
73,3,3,talk,Toshio,,The town’s fixed rate and quick train access solve my main worry. I’m voting for the hot spring town.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Toshio"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Toshio: The town’s fixed rate and quick train access solve my main worry. I’m voting for the hot spring town.""}]}"
74,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,I’m still worried about the shared room and fixed times. I need a private space to sit and wash without a timetable.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Sakura,,"I’m voting for the city. If we each pay our own separate bills, the money is clear and nobody is out of pocket.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Victoria,,"I’m voting for the island. One bill, divided evenly, means I know the total cost before we commit.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Midori,,"I’m voting for the hot spring town. The streets and public bath offer the balance we need, and the train is quick.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Toshio,,I’m voting for the hot spring town. The ninety-minute train is far better than losing two days to the ferry.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Daisuke,,I’m voting for the city. I need a private room with a door to sit and wash without a fixed timetable.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
